document.write('<p>Colin O\'Donoghue plays a skeptical seminarian ordered to an exorcism academy in Rome. Anthony Hopkins chewing scenery as his teacher ? and more than a touch of camp storytelling ? make for a promising prospect, but <em>The Rite</em> plods along, offering neither shock nor scare.</p><p><a href=\"http://www.npr.org/templates/email/emailAFriend.php?storyId=133182395\">» E-Mail This</a>     <a href=\"http://del.icio.us/post?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.npr.org%2Ftemplates%2Fstory%2Fstory.php%3FstoryId%3D133182395\">» Add to Del.icio.us</a></p>');
